WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.080 align:start position:19%
I have read every theory out there, none
of them fit perfectly, and that is

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:11.520 align:start position:19%
exactly what makes it perfect horror.
The scariest stories are not the ones

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:14.480 align:start position:19%
with monsters. They are the ones with
loose ends.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:21.440 align:start position:19%
Loose ends that are still out there
tonight in New Jersey on a quiet street

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:24.800 align:start position:19%
watching.
So, if you ever find a letter with no

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:30.720 align:start position:19%
return address made out to the new
owner, do not open it on the porch.

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:35.760 align:start position:19%
Open it inside, lock every door, and
check which bedrooms face the street.

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:39.400 align:start position:19%
This has been Midnight Dread Tales, real
stories, real dread. I will see you in

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:44.440 align:start position:19%
the next one.
If

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:44.440 align:start position:19%
subscribe for more true horror stories.

